JSON.parse(text) is called on raw Printify API response bodies without validation. A malformed or malicious response could cause prototype pollution. Fix — wrap in a try/catch with a type check:

try { body = JSON.parse(text); } catch { body = text; }
if (body !== null && typeof body === "object") Object.freeze(Object.getPrototypeOf(body));

